tests/cbmc/upstream: the toy upstream of tests/qp/cbmc.sh (the tests of `tools/qp import-cbmc`).

toy/ is written for these tests.

mqtt/ and aws/ mix small excerpts of public CBMC proofs, kept as they are so that the importer is tested on
real harness text, with stand-ins written for these tests (each stand-in says so in its first comment). The
stand-ins are not the projects' code.

